WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.110
If you ever know somebody

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:06.229
who needs help,

00:00:06.229 --> 00:00:09.549
if you&nbsp;know somebody who is scared,

00:00:09.905 --> 00:00:11.546
be kind to them,

00:00:12.672 --> 00:00:15.808
give him advice,

00:00:15.808 --> 00:00:17.836
give him a&nbsp;hug,

00:00:17.836 --> 00:00:20.078
teach him a card trick.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.390
Whatever you're going to do,

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:27.669
it's going to be&nbsp;hope for them,

00:00:27.669 --> 00:00:30.305
and if you do it at the right time,

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.303
it will enter their heart

00:00:33.303 --> 00:00:37.090
and it will&nbsp;be with them 
wherever they go

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:38.304
forever.

